@flexiarg operator/approve-the-whole-list-of-candidates
@title approve the whole list of candidates
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-Th9wmo turn-zBJQsI; first proposed for: The agent has put several items to the operator.
@why [agent/scope-before-action]

! conclusion: Take every item in the last list as accepted and proceed on them.

  + IF:
    The operator says 'Those are fine'.

  + HOWEVER:
    He does not name the items, so the agent has to bind 'those' to its last list.

  + THEN:
    Take every item in the last list as accepted and proceed on them.

  + BECAUSE:
    The operator has judged the list as a whole.
